   "html": "<p>IHC invited a crowd of 150 cultural influencers, horror lovers, and film buffs to come together for a spooky and mystical evening hosted in the appropriately gothic venue Cages. </p>\n<p>Director and composer Michael Giacchino introduced the special to the audience while The Cobrasnake grabbed pics of all in attendance, making this a night to remember for all.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "PARTY & ATMOSPHERE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>A glowing logo on the exterior building greeted guests as they checked in. Once inside, a moody entrance decked out with flickering candles, skulls and a title treatment hologram set the tone for the rest of the evening. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Logo projections, a lifesize lit-up tree, and actual props from the film transformed the space even further. Before the screening, a larger than life hologram greeted attendees in the theater.</p>"
