  {
   "title": "photo moment",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Guests had the opportunity to put themselves in Gael Garcia Bernal’s place and become the Werewolf By Night in this epic poster recreation by Tommy B. Staged with a backdrop and setting that allowed attendees to feel the practicality, in reality, this was a fully digital production that offered immediate social shareability along with take-home prints.</p>"
